  <spoon:CtClass name="BoilerConstants">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="Constant characteristics of the boiler, the steam exit, the pumps and the&#xA;communication rhythm. The requirements name these quantities but give no&#xA;values; the values below are chosen so that MIN_LIMIT &amp;lt; MIN_NORMAL &amp;lt;&#xA;MAX_NORMAL &amp;lt; MAX_LIMIT &amp;lt; CAPACITY and the four pumps together can&#xA;out-supply the maximal steam rate."/>
